Resistor color codes
Code  Color   Value
B     Black   0
N     Brown   1
R     Red     2
O     Orange  3
Y     Yellow  4
G     Green   5
E     Blue    6
V     Violet  7
A     Gray    8
W     White   9
Resistance of B N R = 100.000000 ohms
Resistance of O Y G = 3.400000 mega-ohms
Resistance of E V A = 6700.000000 mega-ohms
Resistance of W B B = 90.000000 ohms
Resistance of N R O = 12.000000 kilo-ohms
Resistance of R O Y = 230.000000 kilo-ohms
Resistance of A N N = 810.000000 ohms
Resistance of Y G E = 45.000000 mega-ohms
Resistance of G E V = 560.000000 mega-ohms
Resistance of E V A = 6700.000000 mega-ohms
Resistance of V A W = 78000.000000 mega-ohms
